{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-10-3-3:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_10_3_3\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_10_3_3:p1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本节规定可疑且非预期严重不良反应（SUSAR）快速报告的随访要求。针对新获得或变更的SUSAR信息，应独立启动随访报告时限：获知新的SUSAR信息后应尽快报告；致死或危及生命的SUSAR随访报告应在首次报告后8日内提交，其他SUSAR随访报告应在15日内提交。存在随访信息补充或因果关系分歧时，不得因此延迟报告。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_10_3_3:p2\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"SUSAR随访报告应提交至药品监督管理部门、卫生健康主管部门、伦理委员会，以及所有参加临床试验的研究者/机构。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_10_3_3:p3\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"SUSAR随访报告应记录随访过程、新信息、报告日期、接收方、破盲信息和因果关系评估，并保留源文件。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_10_3_3:p4\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"如研究者与申办者对因果关系判断不一致，应保留双方评估意见和依据；存在分歧时按更可能相关或更保守的判断进行报告，不得因分歧延迟报告。申办者不得单方面驳回研究者判定的可疑相关性，研究者与申办者的分歧必须保留并记录。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"e0f2e84f7a1a438ab01b6f57855b9448aec025efde82d59f946c1cba718ee9d8"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:7532184ac438f422b3a06ca9ff7d9fa5c2f84e1f7b8468b40e4fac60e443e342:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:7532184ac438f422b3a06ca9ff7d9fa5c2f84e1f7b8468b40e4fac60e443e342:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"7daa806f611b19c0952d9f7099d1cd6a887df165f14c439a24fa2af1363ae250","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319